  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-autospace:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Noise from plant and equipment, including ventilation extract\r\nsystems and flues, when measured at a position one meter external to the\r\nnearest noise sensitive premises shall be at least 10dB(A) below the typical\r\nunderlying background noise level (LA90) when all plant/equipment is in\r\noperation. The underlying background LA90 shall be determined in accordance\r\nwith&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;BS4142:2014 +A1:2019 ‘Methods for rating and assessing industrial\r\nand commercial sound’.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and supporting documents and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawing number (add reference number)dated (date on the plans) - documents entitled (document title) dated (date on the document)",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-autospace:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;nti-vibration mounts shall be installed where necessary, to\r\nprevent the transmission of structure borne noise and vibration causing\r\nnuisance within any adjacent or adjoining premises.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-autospace:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-autospace:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone&quot;&gt;Individual plant items will need to be designed to a lower limit such\r\nthat the cumulative noise level from all plant items achieves the plant noise\r\nlevel limits. In line with BS 4142:2014+A-2019.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
